%T Towards a verified Lustre compiler with modular reset
%@ 9781450357807
%U https://doi.org/10.1145/3207719.3207732
%R 10.1145/3207719.3207732
%X This paper presents ongoing work to add a modular reset construct to a verified Lustre compiler. We present a novel formal specification for the construct and sketch our plans to integrate it into the compiler and its correctness proof.
%B Proceedings of the 21st International Workshop on Software and Compilers for Embedded Systems
%I Association for Computing Machinery
%A Timothy Bourke
%A Lélio Brun
%A Marc Pouzet
%D 2018
%P 14–17
