%X On behalf of the Organizing Committee, I extend a warm welcome to you at the 39th Annual ACM Symposium on Applied Computing (SAC 2024), taking place in Ávila, Spain, and hosted by the University of Salamanca. For more than three decades, this international forum has been dedicated to computer scientists, engineers, and practitioners, providing a platform for presenting their research findings and results in various areas of applied computing. The organizing committee sincerely appreciates your participation in this exciting international event, and we hope that the conference proves interesting and beneficial for all attendees.
