%A Margaret Martonosi
%A David McKay
%A Jim Misewich
%A Mark Ritter
%A Robert Schoelkopf
%A Samuel Stein
%A Sara Sussman
%A Hong Tang
%A Wei Tang
%A Teague Tomesh
%A Norm Tubman
%A Chen Wang
%A Nathan Wiebe
%A Yongxin Yao
%A Dillon Yost
