%A Jan Hückelheim
%A Johannes Doerfert
%A Paul Hovland
%D 2022
%P Article 60
%K C++, Enzyme, Julia, LLVM, MPI, OpenMP, RAJA, automatic differentiation, compiler, distributed, hybrid parallelization, parallel, tasks
%C Dallas, Texas

