%T Proceedings of the 2024 International Conference on Parallel Architectures and Compilation Techniques
%@ 9798400706318
%X Welcome to the International Conference on Parallel Architectures and Compilation Techniques (PACT), held in Long Beach, California, USA, October 13-16, 2024. PACT continues its tradition of a unique technical conference sitting at the intersection of hardware and software, with a special emphasis on parallelism. The PACT conference series brings together researchers from computer architectures, compilers, execution environments, programming languages, and applications, to share and discuss their latest research findings. This year's program showcases a wide range of topics, from classic parallel programming languages, compiles, reconfigurable parallelism, to distributed, heterogeneous architectures, in-memory computing, and architectures for AI. Additionally, PACT'24 introduced an exciting new focus on quantum and neuromorphic computing, exploring these areas both as applications and tools for architectures and compilers. In addition to the regular research papers, PACT 2024 features a special category of papers called "tools and practical experiences" (TPE). These papers emphasize applicability, such as traditional methods employed in emerging fields, aiming to highlight the challenges and experiences faced by the industry as opportunities to guide future research.
%I Association for Computing Machinery
%D 2024
%C Long Beach, CA, USA

