%I Association for Computing Machinery
%A David Svoboda
%A William Klieber
%A Lori Flynn
%A Ruben Martins
%A Jeffrey Hoskinson
%D 2026
%P 97–111
%K C, LLMs, Rust, SAT, lightweight formal methods, static analysis, temporal memory safety
%C Boulder, CO, USA

