%T Proceedings of the 27th ACM SIGPLAN/SIGBED International Conference on Languages, Compilers, and Tools for Embedded Systems
%@ 9798400727214
%X Welcome to the ACM SIGPLAN/SIGBED Conference on Languages, Compilers, and Tools for Embedded Systems (LCTES 2026). We have the privilege of organising the 27th edition of this longstanding conference in the beautiful and scenic city of Boulder, CA, USA. This year's conference is co-located with the premier event 47th ACM SIGPLAN Conference on Programming Language Design and Implementation (PLDI 2026), bringing together affiliated research conferences and workshops into a week-long joint meeting. The mission of LCTES is to provide a link between languages, compilers, and tools for embedded systems, bringing together scientists and engineers from these communities. LCTES offers a forum for researchers and developers from either area to come together, interact, share insights, and collaborate on developing novel solutions.
