%X Welcome to the second of three volumes of the ASPLOS 2025 proceedings. This volume includes the papers from the summer submission cycle that underwent a major revision and the directly accepted papers from the fall cycle. There will be one more final volume, which will consist of the accepted revisions from the fall submission cycle.This volume's 88 papers comprise 40 revised papers from the summer cycle, 46 directly accepted papers from the fall cycle, and 2 papers that were deferred from the previous volume to accommodate artifact evaluation (one each from the spring and summer cycles). The table below shows the status so far for all three cycles of the ASPLOS 2025 conference.
