%A Haoyuan Zhang
%A Yidi Bai
%A Maoxue Yu
%A Kai Xu
%A Hailong Liu
%A Xuebin Chi
%D 2026
%P 1181–1195
%K high-performance computing, performance portability, kokkos, sunway architecture, parallel programming model
