%T High-level quantum algorithm programming using Silq
%@ 9798400718694
%U https://doi.org/10.1145/3731545.3744152
%R 10.1145/3731545.3744152
%X Quantum computing, with its vast potential, is fundamentally shaped by the intricacies of quantum mechanics, which both empower and constrain its capabilities. The development of a universal, robust quantum programming language has emerged as a key research focus in this rapidly evolving field. This paper explores Silq, a recent high-level quantum programming language, highlighting its strengths and unique features. We aim to share our insights on designing and implementing high-level quantum algorithms using Silq, demonstrating its practical applications and advantages for quantum programming.
