%@ 9798400721458
%X It is our pleasure to welcome you to FARM 2025, the 13th ACM SIGPLAN International Workshop on Functional Art, Music, Modeling, and Design! FARM gathers together people from across disciplines who are harnessing functional techniques in the pursuit of creativity and expression.   By gathering researchers, practitioners, artists, designers and anyone interested, FARM aims to develop this interdisciplinary field. Work in this challenging area has already led to new language designs, abstraction techniques, and execution models, as well as the use of old ideas in new, novel, and surprising ways.
