%T A history of Haskell: being lazy with class
%@ 9781595937667
%U https://doi.org/10.1145/1238844.1238856
%R 10.1145/1238844.1238856
%X This paper describes the history of Haskell, including its genesis and principles, technical contributions, implementations and tools, and applications and impact.
